<title>USA: S&amp;P puts MBIA Inc on the S&amp;P 500 Index.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P puts MBIA Inc on the S&amp;P 500 Index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Equity Services Group of Standard &amp; Poor's said on Monday it will put MBIA Inc in the S&amp;P 500 Index, replacing Consolidated Freightways Inc after the close of trading on December 2.</p>
<p>The addition will follow the spin-off by Consolidated Freightways of its national long-haul trucking unit. After the spin-off, Consolidated Freightways will replace Ennis Business Forms in the S&amp;P MidCap 400 Index, the company said.</p>
<p>S&amp;P is a unit of McGraw-Hill Cos Inc.</p>
</text>
